---
import { ArrowsLeftRightIcon, GlobeIcon } from "@phosphor-icons/react";
const metrics = [["Structure", "Shared navigation pattern", "Observed"], ["Contact reuse", "+63 915…0101", "Observed"], ["Assets", "3 visual similarities", "Needs review"], ["Identifiers", "2 normalized matches", "Observed"]];
---

<section id="compare" class="section compare-section"><div class="shell"><div class="section-heading section-heading--center"><p class="section-label"><span class="lang-id">Perbandingan tanpa tuduhan</span><span class="lang-en">Comparison without accusation</span></p><h2><span class="lang-id">Kemiripan adalah bukti —<br />bukan putusan.</span><span class="lang-en">Similarity is evidence —<br />not a verdict.</span></h2><p><span class="lang-id">HAWK-EYE membandingkan observasi yang dipreservasi. Kemiripan tidak diubah menjadi identitas, kepemilikan, kesalahan, atau atribusi operator.</span><span class="lang-en">HAWK-EYE compares preserved observations. It does not convert resemblance into identity, ownership, guilt, or operator attribution.</span></p></div><div class="compare-card"><header><div><span class="domain-icon"><GlobeIcon aria-hidden="true" /></span><div><small><span class="lang-id">Domain sumber</span><span class="lang-en">Source domain</span></small><strong>qq101uok.com</strong></div></div><span class="compare-mark"><ArrowsLeftRightIcon aria-hidden="true" /></span><div><span class="domain-icon domain-icon--pending"><GlobeIcon aria-hidden="true" /></span><div><small><span class="lang-id">Domain kandidat</span><span class="lang-en">Candidate domain</span></small><strong>qq101uok.net</strong></div></div><span class="review-badge"><span class="lang-id">Perlu ditinjau</span><span class="lang-en">Needs review</span></span></header><div class="compare-metrics">{metrics.map(([name, value, state]) => <div><span>{name}</span><strong>{value}</strong><small>{state}</small></div>)}</div><blockquote><span class="lang-id">“HAWK-EYE tidak pernah melabeli domain sebagai ‘operator yang sama.’ Sistem menyajikan bukti terstruktur untuk interpretasi manusia.”</span><span class="lang-en">“HAWK-EYE never labels domains as ‘same operator.’ It provides structured evidence for human interpretation.”</span></blockquote></div></div></section>
